W200DS SukiSU Kernel 是一个非官方聚合项目和面向特定设备的移植版本。

Linux 内核及 SukiSU/KernelSU 衍生内核代码继续受本源码树中随附的
GPL-2.0-only 和逐文件 SPDX 声明约束。KernelPatch 运行时源码位于
tools/kernelpatch-runtime，并保留自身的 GPL-2.0 许可证和声明。
SUSFS 衍生代码保留上游版权声明，GPL-3.0-or-later 文本存放在
LICENSES/third-party/SUSFS-GPL-3.0-or-later.txt。

本源码仓库不包含 OEM 固件、私钥、Manager APK 或第三方 root 模块。
组件版本和本次发布的再分发说明请参阅
Documentation/w200ds/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md。

--- English ---

W200DS SukiSU Kernel is an unofficial aggregation and device-specific port.

The Linux kernel and the SukiSU/KernelSU-derived kernel code remain subject to
the GPL-2.0-only and per-file SPDX notices shipped in this source tree.
KernelPatch runtime source is kept in tools/kernelpatch-runtime with its own
GPL-2.0 license and notices. SUSFS-derived code keeps its upstream copyright
notices and the GPL-3.0-or-later text copied to
LICENSES/third-party/SUSFS-GPL-3.0-or-later.txt.

No OEM firmware, private key, Manager APK or third-party root module is part of
the source repository. See Documentation/w200ds/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for
component revisions and the release-specific redistribution note.
